    "text": "Start A project Contact us Logpom, Douala, Cameroun contact@alivaon.com +237 6 91 96 21 58 Home About Our Services Portfolio Blog FAQ Contact CONTACT US FAQ Frequently asked questions All your questions about our business software and applications in Cameroon How much does custom software cost in Cameroon? Pricing tailored to your project and budget. Free quote after we analyse your business needs. What are the delivery timelines? 3 to 12 months depending on complexity, in 2-week sprints with regular deliveries. How do you digitalise an SME in Cameroon? We analyse your processes and build tools suited to your sector and your local budget. Is my data secure? Yes - OWASP security practices, secure hosting and guaranteed confidentiality of your business data. Do you provide maintenance after delivery? Yes, maintenance contracts with guaranteed SLAs. We remain your long-term technical partner. Do you work with businesses in Douala? Yes - SMEs, micro-businesses and large companies in Douala, Yaoundé and across Cameroon. Frequently asked questions - Digitalisation & Software in Cameroon Can't find the answer to your question? Talk to an expert - Free quote strategy marketing analysis marketing strategy marketing analysis marketing About Alivaon As a custom software company, we help businesses grow with innovative, reliable and sustainable web, mobile and enterprise solutions. Quick Links About Contact Portfolio Blog Our Services Resources FAQ Careers Our Team Legal Notice Privacy Policy Subscribe to our newsletter SUBSCRIBE SUBSCRIBE Copyright © 2026 Alivaon, All rights reserved.",
